{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-subagent#card-zh","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-subagent","commit":"8808df0fabc541ab7526293945da415878360048","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-subagent 是面向 DSH Web 与 Desktop 客户端的远端子代理插件。它注册 remote_agent 工具，并提供远端代理面板，通过 SSH 将任务交给另一台机器上的 DSH headless 进程。用户可以启动独立远端运行、等待或查看状态与事件、追加到同一远端会话、列出机器和运行记录，也可以取消运行。事件和结果会流回本地，面板支持浏览运行详情。适合需要在另一台已配置机器上执行 DSH 任务并在本地跟进进度的场景；需要可用的 SSH 凭据和远端 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113-128","lib/index.js:135-219","lib/runs.js:302-369","lib/client.js:520-525"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-subagent#card-en","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-subagent","commit":"8808df0fabc541ab7526293945da415878360048","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote-subagent lets a local DSH delegate tasks over SSH to a remote DSH. Use remote_agent to start, inspect, continue, or cancel runs and view streamed events and results. A panel lists machines and run details. Requires SSH credentials and remote dsh headless.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113-128","lib/index.js:135-219","lib/runs.js:302-369","lib/client.js:520-525"]}
