{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-subagent#feature-1","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-subagent","commit":"8808df0fabc541ab7526293945da415878360048","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-subagent 的功能「远端任务派发」：通过 remote_agent 的 spawn 操作，将任务经 SSH 交给远端 DSH headless 执行，并返回运行编号供后续查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:135-147","lib/runs.js:302-369"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-subagent#feature-2","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-subagent","commit":"8808df0fabc541ab7526293945da415878360048","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-subagent 的功能「运行过程查看」：调用 get 或打开远端代理面板，可查看运行状态、最近事件和结果；远端事件流会转为本地可浏览的记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:163-173","lib/runs.js:233-270","lib/client.js:520-525"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-subagent#feature-3","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-subagent","commit":"8808df0fabc541ab7526293945da415878360048","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-subagent 的功能「续接远端对话」：远端运行产生 session id 后，可用 send 在同一远端会话派发新一轮消息，任务完成后再查看新运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:175-183","lib/runs.js:459-474"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-subagent#feature-4","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-subagent","commit":"8808df0fabc541ab7526293945da415878360048","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-subagent 的功能「远端运行管理」：remote_agent 支持列出最近运行、取消运行和查看已配置远端机器；等待操作可设置时长，超时后远端运行仍可继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:149-161","lib/index.js:185-215"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-remote-subagent#caveat-1","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-remote-subagent","commit":"8808df0fabc541ab7526293945da415878360048","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-subagent 使用前须知：远端目标来自 DSH_HOME 下的机器注册表，且远端需能运行 dsh headless；连接需要注册表中的 SSH 凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/machines.js:16-26","lib/machines.js:89-119"]}
